  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Global Coalition against ISIL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation with civilian groups to promote community engagement and peaceful participation as a positive alternative to radicalization. The civilian groups produce strategic information, which furthers a moderate view on the society and promote increased resilience in the local communities against VEOs.</narrative>
  </description>
